urny, Bouriat, and Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":0,"text":"After a storm, the organizers have scratched the first day's race; everything rides on Wednesday.","q":false},{"lap":0,"text":"The Wednesday weather turned out to be fine and sunny.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"\"Williams\" immediately took the lead, followed by Lehoux, Fourny, Bouriat, and Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"\"Williams\" finished the first lap in 2m34s, already beating the former lap record by two seconds, with Etancelin and Lehoux following him some 100 meters behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"\"Williams\" finished the first lap in 2m34s, already beating the former lap record by two seconds, with Etancelin and Lehoux following him some 100 meters behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap \"Williams\" was lowering the lap record to 2m27s. Lehoux was now up to second position and behind him followed Etancelin, Bouriat and Fourny.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap \"Williams\" was lowering the lap record to 2m27s. Lehoux was now up to second position and behind him followed Etancelin, Bouriat and Fourny.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"After the third lap the order was \"Williams\", Fourny, Lehoux and Bouriat. Falchetto had moved up to fifth while Etancelin had fallen backwards.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":3,"text":"After the third lap the order was \"Williams\", Fourny, Lehoux and Bouriat. Falchetto had moved up to fifth while Etancelin had fallen backwards.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":4,"text":"On the fourth lap \"Williams\" was closely followed by Fourny and Bouriat while Lehoux was in trouble and had lost a position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":4,"text":"On the fourth lap \"Williams\" was closely followed by Fourny and Bouriat while Lehoux was in trouble and had lost a position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":5,"text":"Bouriat passed Fourny and took up the chase on \"Williams\", who was now leading by 3 seconds. De Maleplane had passed Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":5,"text":"Bouriat passed Fourny and took up the chase on \"Williams\", who was now leading by 3 seconds. De Maleplane had passed Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":6,"text":"Lehoux retired on the sixth lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":6,"text":"Lehoux retired on the sixth lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":7,"text":"Bouriat is quicker in the hairpins, but Williams gains so much on the straights that Bouriat cannot get close enough to attack; Fourny drops away.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":7,"text":"Bouriat is quicker in the hairpins, but Williams gains so much on the straights that Bouriat cannot get close enough to attack; Fourny drops away.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":8,"text":"Williams laps in 2m28s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Williams laps in 2m28s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":12,"text":"\"Williams\" made both lap 11 & 12 in 2m27s. Race order: \"Williams\", Bouriat, Falchetto, de Maleplane, Fourny, Etancelin and Druck.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":12,"text":"\"Williams\" made both lap 11 & 12 in 2m27s. Race order: \"Williams\", Bouriat, Falchetto, de Maleplane, Fourny, Etancelin and Druck.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":13,"text":"Etancelin retires on the 13th lap, as does Hell\u00e9-Nice.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":13,"text":"Etancelin retires on the 13th lap, as does Hell\u00e9-Nice.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":15,"text":"Williams keeps lapping under 2m30s; after 15 laps he leads Bouriat by 27 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Williams keeps lapping under 2m30s; after 15 laps he leads Bouriat by 27 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"On lap 18 Williams sets a new lap record, 2m25s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"On lap 18 Williams sets a new lap record, 2m25s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"Over five laps Williams has added 24 seconds more to his lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"Over five laps Williams has added 24 seconds more to his lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"Williams wins about 1 1/2 minutes ahead of Bouriat; Falchetto, lapped, is third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"De Malaplane was fourth, Ducouret fifth, Montier with the big special sixth, and Mme Siko seventh and winner of the \"Ladies Cup\". Fourny was eighth and Desvaud ninth and last to complete the 25 laps winning Coupe Mohammad Hassan as the best 1.5 liter car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":25,"text":"Williams wins about 1 1/2 minutes ahead of Bouriat; Falchetto, lapped, is third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"De Malaplane was fourth, Ducouret fifth, Montier with the big special sixth, and Mme Siko seventh and winner of the \"Ladies Cup\". Fourny was eighth and Desvaud ninth and last to complete the 25 laps winning Coupe Mohammad Hassan as the best 1.5 liter car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6}]}